      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{d}{dx}(\\tan^3x)&=3\\tan^2x\\sec^2x\\\\\\tan^2x\\sec^2x&=\\frac13\\times3\\tan^2x\\sec^2x\\\\\\int\\tan^2x\\sec^2x\\,dx&=\\frac13\\tan^3x+C\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
